Consumer turn by caller: QM's per-turn provider recall, the model's memory search through the provider, and the model's own gbrain calls. Calls columns count calls summed over trials; the rest count trials. Search delivery is an upper bound, and so is the model column: gbrain returned the fact, and QM may cut a tool result before the model sees it. A provider read whose match was too large to run counts as not delivered and in the unknown column.

